    {
      "block_id": "2605.28615_p5_b34",
      "text": "(b) This picture shows one TextDPO process with region-level guidance. TextDPO, as an extension of Diffusion DPO,\nkeep the prefered sample to be the preferred image with the preferred caption, while altering the less prefered sample to\nbe the preferred image with the less preferred caption. The region-level guidance is applied during the loss calculation to\nguide the model to focus on the most relevant regions.\n",
      "bbox": [
        70.57,
        463.89,
        542.25,
        507.47
      ],
