    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.28615_p5_b35",
      "text": "Figure 2 Overview of our proposed BiDPO. (a) BiDPO integrates bimodal(image and text) preference alignment; (b)\nDiffusion process and loss calculation with region-level guidance.\n",
