    {
      "block_id": "2605.28615_p5_b37",
      "text": "0, which means that image xl\n0 and caption yl are the preferred pair\nand this diffusion process should be enhanced. By combining these two losses, we effectively establish that\nimage xl\n",
      "bbox": [
